        card("Numbers in Tagalog and Spanish (Activity 6, the book’s answers)", "Tagalog numbers: " + ", ".join(str(n) for n in _NUMS_TL) + ". Spanish derivative numbers: " + ", ".join(str(n) for n in _NUMS_SP) + ". The exercises below drill reading them."),
